{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Visual novel meets management sim.</strong> After your master's spell goes awry, you, a lowly goblin, suddenly find yourself in a position of power. Thanks to the magical mishap, you have become the ruling lord of the realm! You\u2019ll need to govern your lands, renovate your manor, and most importantly- train up your na\u00efve maids into a team of skilled servants!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2483850/extras/4d3cea57beb684a300889a70babe2a46.poster.avif?t=1770614908\" width=610 height=120 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2483850/extras/4d3cea57beb684a300889a70babe2a46.webm?t=1770614908\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2483850/extras/4d3cea57beb684a300889a70babe2a46.mp4?t=1770614908\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Real lords make the tough decisions.</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Someone\u2019s got to take charge, so why not a goblin? Many people doubt you, but Greenwood needs a strong ruler who knows how to protect them, just like maids (and Az\u2019ea) sometimes need guidance and discipline.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2483850/extras/d0c23f3c2c7cad74fa453e5a3b5e07f2.poster.avif?t=1770614908\" width=610 height=120 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2483850/extras/d0c23f3c2c7cad74fa453e5a3b5e07f2.webm?t=1770614908\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2483850/extras/d0c23f3c2c7cad74fa453e5a3b5e07f2.mp4?t=1770614908\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>BEAUTIFUL ARTWORK:</strong> lovingly crafted erotic illustrations and animations!</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>TIME MANAGEMENT:</strong> you are in charge scheduling your servants tasks!</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>GRAND STORY:</strong> from rags to riches, enjoy- and defend- your newfound fortune!</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>PARTIAL VOICE ACTING:</strong> talented voice performances bring the characters to life!</p></li></ul>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/2483850?t=1770614908","background_raw":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/2483850?t=1770614908","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2483850/7fa71777d26da2cea055a2d06b6086d2b09330c9/capsule_231x87_alt_assets_2.jpg?t=1770614908","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2483850/7fa71777d26da2cea055a2d06b6086d2b09330c9/capsule_184x69_alt_assets_2.jpg?t=1770614908","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Steam Trading Cards","id":29},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[1,3,4,5],"notes":"This game is dark fantasy and contains depictions of sexual interactions, mainly between humans and a goblin. This includes: cuckoldry, bondage/discipline themes, and dubiously consensual sex via hypnotism/magic."},"detailed_description":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Visual novel meets management sim.</strong> After your master's spell goes awry, you, a lowly goblin, suddenly find yourself in a position of power. Thanks to the magical mishap, you have become the ruling lord of the realm! You\u2019ll need to govern you